 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "借り箱のメモと農園の記録を読みました。農園と同じ原因だとは言えませんが、比較の方法は参考になりますね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D001-S01",
    "C69-D001-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 7.924,
   "duration_sec": 7.924
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "そうですね。七日に店を閉めた時は三十八個、目標との差は二個。十二個が全部なくなったわけではありませんね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D002-S01",
    "C69-D002-S02",
    "C69-D002-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 8.274,
   "end_sec": 18.581,
   "duration_sec": 10.307
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "はい。でも、何度も相談したあげく印刷に間に合わなかった経緯は、反省として残したいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D003-S01",
    "C69-D003-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 18.931,
   "end_sec": 25.487,
   "duration_sec": 6.556
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "印刷の判断をする日を決めていなかったのは、二人の問題です。岸さんだけの責任とは思いません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D004-S01",
    "C69-D004-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 25.837,
   "end_sec": 32.14,
   "duration_sec": 6.303
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "あの日に戻れるものなら、準備の時間をもっと取りたいです。紙ならすぐできると思ったのが誤算でした。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D005-S01",
    "C69-D005-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 32.49,
   "end_sec": 39.397,
   "duration_sec": 6.907
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "その気持ちは分かります。次は期限を決めましょう。ただ、返却数との関係は分けて考えたいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D006-S01",
    "C69-D006-S02",
    "C69-D006-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 39.747,
   "end_sec": 47.118,
   "duration_sec": 7.371
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "期限について質問があったことから、案内に問題があったと考えました。その判断も強すぎますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D007-S01",
    "C69-D007-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 47.468,
   "end_sec": 54.629,
   "duration_sec": 7.161
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "二つの期限が書いてあった事実もあります。問題はありましたが、それが十二個の原因かどうかは別です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D008-S01",
    "C69-D008-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 54.979,
   "end_sec": 62.603,
   "duration_sec": 7.624
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "なるほど。「急いだばかりに失敗した」は私の解釈で、原因を証明した言葉ではないんですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D009-S01",
    "C69-D009-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 62.953,
   "end_sec": 69.788,
   "duration_sec": 6.835
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "ええ。次に試す方法を選ぶために、戻った箱と戻らない箱の状況を、もう少し知りたいんです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D010-S01",
    "C69-D010-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "replacement_audio"
   ],
   "start_sec": 70.138,
   "end_sec": 77.559,
   "duration_sec": 7.421
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "番号を付ける案はどうでしょう。貸した日と戻った日なら、名前を聞かなくても記録できます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D011-S01",
    "C69-D011-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 77.909,
   "end_sec": 83.852,
   "duration_sec": 5.943
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "賛成ですが、休憩を犠牲にして記録を増やそうものなら、状況が悪化します。忙しい時間を避けましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D012-S01",
    "C69-D012-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 84.202,
   "end_sec": 92.316,
   "duration_sec": 8.114
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "では、店を閉めた後に、私たちだけで記録の練習をしませんか。一個に何秒かかるか測ってみます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D013-S01",
    "C69-D013-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 92.666,
   "end_sec": 99.919,
   "duration_sec": 7.253
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "それなら判断できますね。休憩を減らさなくてもできるか、実際の作業を試した上で決めましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D014-S01",
    "C69-D014-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 100.269,
   "end_sec": 106.363,
   "duration_sec": 6.094
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "アプリの契約は、まだしないんですね。月六千円で手間が減る可能性はありますが、使っていませんから。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D015-S01",
    "C69-D015-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 106.713,
   "end_sec": 113.655,
   "duration_sec": 6.942
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "はい。箱が戻っても費用が増えすぎれば、店の利益は減ります。返却数だけでは判断できません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D016-S01",
    "C69-D016-S02",
    "C69-D016-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 114.005,
   "end_sec": 120.672,
   "duration_sec": 6.667
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "お金も時間も使う前に、紙で十分か確認するわけですね。遠回りに見えても、必要な確認ですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D017-S01",
    "C69-D017-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 121.022,
   "end_sec": 128.636,
   "duration_sec": 7.614
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "そうです。工夫すれば必ず成功するとは言えませんが、同じ疑問を残したまま繰り返したくありません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D018-S01",
    "C69-D018-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 128.986,
   "end_sec": 135.637,
   "duration_sec": 6.651
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "次を十五日から始めるかどうかは、いつ決めますか。お知らせには、まだ開始日を書いていません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D019-S01",
    "C69-D019-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 135.987,
   "end_sec": 142.473,
   "duration_sec": 6.486
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D020",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "十二日に店を閉めた後で練習して、十三日に再検討しましょう。問題が残れば、十五日には始めません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D020-S01",
    "C69-D020-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 142.823,
   "end_sec": 150.361,
   "duration_sec": 7.538
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D021",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "分かりました。私は番号と記録に使う紙の準備を引き受けます。期限の案内も同じ表現にします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D021-S01",
    "C69-D021-S02",
    "C69-D021-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 150.711,
   "end_sec": 157.567,
   "duration_sec": 6.856
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D022",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "では、私は別の店員に案内を読んでもらいます。説明を聞く前にどう理解するか、確認したいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D022-S01",
    "C69-D022-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 157.917,
   "end_sec": 165.045,
   "duration_sec": 7.128
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D023",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "目標も四十個のままにしますか。次に貸す数が決まっていないので、先に数字だけは書けませんね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D023-S01",
    "C69-D023-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 165.395,
   "end_sec": 171.85,
   "duration_sec": 6.455
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D024",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "そうですね。実施するかどうかと一緒に決断しましょう。次も五十個にする必要はありません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D024-S01",
    "C69-D024-S02",
    "C69-D024-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 172.2,
   "end_sec": 179.43,
   "duration_sec": 7.23
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D025",
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "問題を一つ直しても、状況が必ず好転するわけではないですね。次も結果と経緯を記録します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D025-S01",
    "C69-D025-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 179.78,
   "end_sec": 187.572,
   "duration_sec": 7.792
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D026",
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "ええ。今回の教訓は、誰の責任かを急いで決めないで、どの作業を変えるか考えることだと思います。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D026-S01",
    "C69-D026-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 187.922,
   "end_sec": 196.211,
   "duration_sec": 8.289
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D027",
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "岸",
   "source_text": "長く話し合った末に、次に確認することが具体的になりました。今日の決定をメモに追加します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D027-S01",
    "C69-D027-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 196.561,
   "end_sec": 203.673,
   "duration_sec": 7.112
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C69-D028",
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "お願いします。開始日はまだ決まっていませんね。次の相談は十三日です。店員にも伝えておきます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C69-D028-S01",
    "C69-D028-S02",
    "C69-D028-S03",
    "C69-D028-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 204.023,
   "end_sec": 211.162,
   "duration_sec": 7.139
  }
 ],
